sp;2) 교원자격증 사본 1부&nbsp;.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">☞ 교원자격증을 1급과 2급 모두 소지한 경우 2급 자격증에 부전공<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 과목을&nbsp;표시하므로 2급 자격증 사본으로 제출해야됨</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 재직증명서 1부&nbsp; .</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011. 11. </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">금오공과대학교 교육대학원장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
